```yaml
xcpgir_version: "1.0"
rule:
  id: "tainted-sql-string"
  kind: taint
  severity: ERROR
  message: "Detected user input used to manually construct a SQL string. This is usually bad practice because manual construction could accidentally result in a SQL injection. An attacker could use a SQL injection to steal or modify contents of the database. Instead, use a parameterized query which is available by default in most database engines. Alternatively, consider using an object-relational mapper (ORM) such as SQLAlchemy which will protect your queries."
  tags:
    - python
    - sqlalchemy
    - flask
  metadata:
    language: python
    category: security

sources:
  - id: USER_INPUT
    match:
      node: CALL
      api:
        type: flask.request
        method: $ANYTHING
  - id: ROUTE_PARAM
    match:
      node: IDENTIFIER
      where:
        - op: regex
          left: code
          right: "^\\$ROUTEVAR$"
        - op: regex
          left: methodFullName
          right: "@\\$APP\\.route\\(.*\\)\\s+def\\s+\\$FUNC"

sinks:
  - id: SQL_CONCAT
    match:
      node: LITERAL
      where:
        - op: regex
          left: code
          right: "\"\\$SQLSTR\" \\+ .+|\"\\$SQLSTR\" % .+|\"\\$SQLSTR\"\\.format\\(.+\\)|f\"\\$SQLSTR\\{.+\\}.+\""
        - op: regex
          left: value
          right: "\\s*(?i)(select|delete|insert|create|update|alter|drop)\\b.*"

sanitizers: []

propagations:
  - id: ARG_TO_ARG
    edge: arg->arg
    kind: taint
  - id: ASSIGN_TO_VAR
    edge: assign->var
    kind: taint
```
Valid: ```yaml
issues:
  - "sources中的ROUTE_PARAM匹配条件过于严格，可能导致漏报。原始规则中$ROUTEVAR是路由函数的任意参数变量"
  - "改进建议：简化ROUTE_PARAM的匹配条件，移除对methodFullName的regex匹配，只需要匹配路由函数参数即可"

  - "propagations缺少对函数返回值的传播路径定义"
  - "改进建议：增加RETURN_TO_ARG的传播路径"

  - "缺少原始规则中metadata里的CWE/OWASP分类等安全相关信息"
  - "改进建议：在rule.metadata中添加cwe/owasp等相关安全分类信息"

  - "sinks匹配中使用value字段可能不准确，应该使用code字段完整匹配SQL字符串"
  - "改进建议：将sinks匹配条件中的left: value改为left: code"
```
